WEBVTT

01:18.660 --> 01:21.960
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.990 --> 01:24.850
[Episode 26]

01:26.350 --> 01:27.280
What did you say?

01:28.400 --> 01:30.070
Dimension-reduction strike.

01:30.070 --> 01:31.130
The previous line.

01:33.680 --> 01:35.590
Outsiders disrupt the industry.

01:39.150 --> 01:39.640
Yes.

01:43.039 --> 01:45.280
I suddenly feel that Fulaxida

01:46.150 --> 01:48.229
may change the idea of recruitment.

01:50.310 --> 01:51.240
What do you mean?

01:51.870 --> 01:53.130
Looking for comrades.

01:53.890 --> 01:55.620
I suddenly thought of someone.

01:57.110 --> 01:59.240
Looking for comrades for investment?

02:02.560 --> 02:03.560
I'm back.

02:04.020 --> 02:05.820
Dinner will be ready soon, baby.

02:08.590 --> 02:10.840
I've nailed the bid for Shanlifang today.

02:10.840 --> 02:12.240
I'm exhausted.

02:12.870 --> 02:13.630
Really?

02:14.190 --> 02:15.560
You're great, baby!

02:16.280 --> 02:17.800
You've worked so hard.

02:18.030 --> 02:18.890
I want a reward.

02:19.030 --> 02:19.750
A reward?

02:20.470 --> 02:21.000
Look.

02:23.530 --> 02:24.380
-All...
-I think today…

02:24.380 --> 02:25.230
Go away.

02:25.590 --> 02:27.190
You haven't washed your hands,
little glutton.

02:27.190 --> 02:28.030
Eat later.

02:28.120 --> 02:29.250
It'll be ready soon.

02:42.520 --> 02:45.150
It feels so good.

02:46.590 --> 02:48.310
You were too busy

02:48.310 --> 02:50.690
and didn't have time to cook for me.

02:51.430 --> 02:53.860
I really enjoy this moment.

02:54.030 --> 02:56.060
I hope it will always be like this.

02:57.070 --> 02:57.750
Okay.

02:58.960 --> 03:00.160
From now on,

03:00.310 --> 03:01.640
I'll be a househusband,

03:02.020 --> 03:02.860
live off you,

03:02.880 --> 03:03.900
and cook for you every day.

03:03.900 --> 03:04.560
Really?

03:04.750 --> 03:05.280
Really.

03:05.490 --> 03:07.620
Okay, then I promise you.

03:07.870 --> 03:09.750
You can rely on me all you want,
eat your fill,

03:09.750 --> 03:11.150
and enjoy every bit of it.

03:11.520 --> 03:12.120
Deal.

03:12.250 --> 03:13.270
Deal.

03:16.630 --> 03:17.380
I'm hungry.

03:17.910 --> 03:18.750
Wait a moment.

03:18.770 --> 03:19.900
It'll be ready soon.

03:22.240 --> 03:25.280
It'll be ready soon. It'll be ready soon.

03:36.820 --> 03:38.170
[Little Smart Roams the Future]

03:39.950 --> 03:41.950
[Little Smart Roams the Future]

03:42.720 --> 03:43.440
Jingjing.

03:43.630 --> 03:47.520
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

03:43.710 --> 03:44.430
Fei.

03:45.000 --> 03:46.750
Guess if I have landed

03:46.750 --> 03:48.710
the Shanlifang charity banquet today.

03:48.710 --> 03:50.040
No question.

03:50.400 --> 03:51.750
Of course, you've landed it.

03:51.750 --> 03:52.450
Who are you?

03:52.520 --> 03:54.579
The legendary queen in the industry.

03:55.560 --> 03:56.280
Of course.

03:57.800 --> 03:58.860
Congratulations.

03:59.000 --> 04:00.240
Is the charity banquet

04:00.240 --> 04:02.280
only a few days away?

04:02.310 --> 04:04.440
So do we have to kick off work tomorrow?

04:06.040 --> 04:07.870
I've arranged it today.

04:09.390 --> 04:10.920
Okay, I won't forget.

04:11.240 --> 04:12.720
I'll help out in a few days.

04:13.630 --> 04:14.430
Really?

04:14.450 --> 04:15.370
That's great.

04:15.400 --> 04:22.100
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

04:16.180 --> 04:18.000
I'm so tired today.

04:18.160 --> 04:19.160
I have to go.

04:19.870 --> 04:20.399
Bye-bye.

04:20.480 --> 04:22.240
Okay, go to bed early, bye-bye.

04:31.440 --> 04:33.170
Your best friend Yao Jingjing?

04:35.310 --> 04:37.040
I think she's quite something.

04:37.430 --> 04:39.390
So many people bid

04:39.409 --> 04:40.820
to host
the huge Shanlifang charity banquet,

04:40.820 --> 04:42.909
but she beat every single one of them out.

04:42.909 --> 04:45.040
She's really something, I'm telling you.

04:45.040 --> 04:46.000
Of course.

04:47.590 --> 04:49.470
But why would she be your friend?

04:49.600 --> 04:51.970
You two aren't even on the same level
when it comes to EQ and IQ.

04:51.970 --> 04:53.480
Are you bored?

05:08.600 --> 05:09.920
Baby, the dinner...

06:30.920 --> 06:31.800
What is it?

06:32.190 --> 06:33.190
Do you want it?

06:34.270 --> 06:34.920
What?

06:35.600 --> 06:36.850
Do you want it?

06:36.580 --> 06:37.960
[Shanghai to Shanxi Flight Ticket]

06:36.950 --> 06:39.600
Well, the flight ticket to my home!

06:41.870 --> 06:43.630
Really! Really?

06:43.630 --> 06:45.290
You didn't edit this, did you?

06:45.510 --> 06:47.190
How could it be fake?

06:49.480 --> 06:52.200
I checked earlier,
and there were no tickets left back then.

06:52.200 --> 06:53.420
How did you get it?

06:56.159 --> 06:57.240
So,

06:57.260 --> 07:00.060
you are quite capable.

07:00.080 --> 07:02.290
There are countless things I've always
wanted but failed to accomplish,

07:02.290 --> 07:04.650
yet they come to you so easily.

07:05.210 --> 07:07.800
I look at you in a whole new light now.

07:08.750 --> 07:10.810
Wait, what did you think of me before?

07:11.600 --> 07:13.180
I could rattle off all your old traits

07:13.180 --> 07:15.180
with my eyes closed.

07:17.410 --> 07:19.690
Vain, pretentious, and sharp-tongued.

07:19.720 --> 07:21.890
Fussy, high-maintenance,
and a total glutton.

07:21.890 --> 07:23.650
Lazy, stuck-up, and hot-tempered.

07:23.650 --> 07:25.400
And the list goes on and on.

07:27.830 --> 07:28.950
Hello?

07:29.120 --> 07:29.980
I want a refund.

07:31.430 --> 07:33.560
You asked me to list them just now.

07:33.580 --> 07:35.240
I'm such an innocent, good-natured person.

07:35.240 --> 07:36.720
I surely can't lie.

07:36.820 --> 07:39.310
Nine flaws just tumbled out of your mouth.

07:39.680 --> 07:42.140
And you even topped it off
with a longer list.

07:43.020 --> 07:43.620
Fine then.

07:43.680 --> 07:45.370
If that's how you truly see me,

07:45.430 --> 07:47.310
I don't need you to look at me
in a new light anymore.

07:47.310 --> 07:49.500
I'll fully live up to

07:49.530 --> 07:50.840
all those endless flaws you named.

07:50.840 --> 07:51.440
Calm down.

07:52.510 --> 07:53.510
Give me another chance.

07:53.510 --> 07:55.010
Let me start over, okay?

07:55.510 --> 07:57.570
Alright, I'll give her another shot.

08:01.160 --> 08:02.220
Meditating again?

08:03.560 --> 08:05.500
I called you vain

08:05.530 --> 08:06.610
because

08:06.950 --> 08:08.560
you're naturally good-looking.

08:08.560 --> 08:10.720
Look how handsome you are, right?

08:10.750 --> 08:13.280
You've got every reason
to flaunt your looks.

08:14.430 --> 08:16.000
I said you're pretentious

08:16.020 --> 08:17.100
because

08:18.680 --> 08:22.150
the way you carry yourself
is effortless and attractive.

08:22.690 --> 08:24.720
You've got such great style,

08:24.750 --> 08:25.420
so classy.

08:29.580 --> 08:31.030
When I said you're sharp-tongued,

08:31.030 --> 08:33.130
that's only because you're quick-witted,

08:33.130 --> 08:33.780
right?

08:33.960 --> 08:36.260
Lots of people wish they
could banter half as well as you.

08:36.260 --> 08:36.740
Right?

08:38.600 --> 08:40.080
You may be fussy,

08:40.100 --> 08:41.030
but it just means

08:41.470 --> 08:44.030
you live with conviction and sincerity,

08:44.270 --> 08:45.500
never cutting corners in life.

08:45.500 --> 08:46.480
You hit the nail on the head.

08:46.480 --> 08:48.130
That proves how responsible you are.

08:48.130 --> 08:49.110
Yes, that's who I am.

08:49.110 --> 08:50.390
I am that kind of person, exactly.

08:50.390 --> 08:52.670
I said you're high-maintenance

08:53.240 --> 08:55.000
only because...

08:57.390 --> 08:58.670
because...

08:59.720 --> 09:00.360
you...

09:02.920 --> 09:04.860
care so much about the quality of life.

09:04.860 --> 09:06.440
You know exactly what you want

09:06.440 --> 09:08.640
and what you deserve to enjoy, right?

09:08.660 --> 09:09.270
You know me very well.

09:09.270 --> 09:11.730
That makes you
a total beacon of positivity.

09:11.890 --> 09:12.750
Yeah, totally.

09:13.420 --> 09:14.800
As for being a glutton,

09:14.870 --> 09:16.600
I should actually be happy.

09:17.200 --> 09:19.730
It just means you love my cooking.

09:19.790 --> 09:21.150
-Yeah.
-You think my cooking is good.

09:21.150 --> 09:23.150
-Yes. You just found out?
-I'm also motivated to cook for you,

09:23.150 --> 09:24.000
aren't I?

09:24.690 --> 09:26.020
And about being lazy...

09:28.000 --> 09:30.600
You're out there handling
important things.

09:30.720 --> 09:33.670
Household chores shouldn't tie you down.

09:34.150 --> 09:34.720
Right?

09:34.790 --> 09:37.500
If you spent all your time on housework,

09:37.670 --> 09:40.020
you wouldn't be able
to get a ticket for me,

09:40.080 --> 09:41.600
-right?
-Of course.

09:43.480 --> 09:46.910
Now the stuck-up part...

09:48.030 --> 09:49.870
Well, I think...

09:52.420 --> 09:55.280
I only added it to rhyme with the rest,

09:55.440 --> 09:57.170
just to make it sound smoother.

09:58.150 --> 10:00.550
Treat it like the high-maintenance point.

10:01.670 --> 10:03.470
Now there's one last trait left.

10:04.020 --> 10:06.050
Hot-tempered. Give me an explanation.

10:06.050 --> 10:07.530
It's because you're...

10:10.240 --> 10:12.180
Back when you

10:12.390 --> 10:14.320
fought with Gui Lili,

10:14.340 --> 10:15.570
I think,

10:17.030 --> 10:19.470
you'd lash out really harshly at her.

10:20.030 --> 10:21.790
But you've never once quarreled with me.

10:21.790 --> 10:24.250
I couldn't possibly

10:24.510 --> 10:25.600
stand on the sidelines

10:25.600 --> 10:27.200
and act all righteous,

10:27.200 --> 10:27.790
could I?

10:30.000 --> 10:30.870
Honestly,

10:31.490 --> 10:33.180
every word you said hits home.

10:33.670 --> 10:35.850
-Right?
-You described me perfectly.

10:38.030 --> 10:40.240
I never thought those harsh labels

10:40.260 --> 10:42.620
could be spun into such nice compliments.

10:42.840 --> 10:45.320
Best of all, you really read my mind.

10:45.340 --> 10:46.070
Right?

10:46.530 --> 10:47.550
So accurate.

10:47.580 --> 10:49.910
Everything you said makes perfect sense,

10:50.180 --> 10:51.780
and I totally agree with you.

10:52.150 --> 10:53.840
But as to the last one,

10:54.390 --> 10:56.030
I thought back carefully,

10:58.200 --> 10:59.600
and I really was...

10:59.630 --> 11:00.200
Right?

11:00.840 --> 11:02.600
Pushed to my limit.

11:04.020 --> 11:06.520
I'll show you my bad temper completely.

11:07.360 --> 11:08.270
Don't go home.

11:08.270 --> 11:09.630
What's the point of heading back?

11:09.630 --> 11:11.630
Stay here and spend the New Year with me.

11:11.630 --> 11:12.510
If I don't teach you a lesson,

11:12.510 --> 11:14.480
you'll never know
what a heartbreaking mistake you've made.

11:14.480 --> 11:15.480
Wait, wait, wait!

11:15.870 --> 11:16.360
What are you doing?

11:16.360 --> 11:18.200
Don't refund, please!

11:18.240 --> 11:18.960
You really can't!

11:18.960 --> 11:19.870
That's not what I meant at all!

11:19.870 --> 11:20.710
I-I-I...

11:20.750 --> 11:22.030
I think you're good-looking.

11:22.030 --> 11:23.170
I spoke without thinking on impulse.

11:23.170 --> 11:24.640
I was just rambling messily.

11:24.640 --> 11:25.500
Don't refund!

11:39.300 --> 11:39.990
Great.

11:40.270 --> 11:42.000
You didn't process the refund.

11:54.330 --> 11:55.240
Thank you.

12:01.640 --> 12:03.350
I can go home now!

12:04.510 --> 12:05.350
Well...

12:05.850 --> 12:07.710
Well, I'll process the refund again.

12:07.710 --> 12:08.830
Give it to me!

12:35.790 --> 12:36.720
Come here.

12:36.760 --> 12:37.160
You...

12:37.840 --> 12:38.270
Hurry.

12:39.120 --> 12:41.120
Why are you blushing like that?

12:44.080 --> 12:46.480
What took you so long, man?

12:46.480 --> 12:47.750
Isn't showing up late perfect?

12:47.750 --> 12:48.870
Saves you some cash.

12:48.870 --> 12:49.910
Ugh, please.

12:57.720 --> 12:59.440
You're always cocky
and chatty on ordinary days,

12:59.440 --> 13:02.300
but never step up to help me
when push comes to shove.

13:10.100 --> 13:12.130
[Chat Messages]

13:10.790 --> 13:12.920
You're here on your alt account again.

13:13.550 --> 13:16.210
I don't feel like messing around
with you today.

13:25.510 --> 13:28.070
[Events] [Little New Year Couple]

13:29.360 --> 13:30.320
Pistachio,

13:31.440 --> 13:34.200
you saw the couple event
for Little New Year, right?

13:34.200 --> 13:35.480
Wanna go to the Matchmaker

13:35.480 --> 13:37.280
and tie the in-game knot with me?

13:37.870 --> 13:40.800
We can finish
all the couple quests while we're at it.

13:41.240 --> 13:42.700
Meet me by the Matchmaker.

13:46.790 --> 13:47.940
[Game Channel]

13:51.910 --> 13:53.030
Oh no, this is bad!

13:53.150 --> 13:54.390
What's wrong, Jun?

13:54.750 --> 13:56.790
Did your mom
give away all your gear again?

13:56.790 --> 13:59.320
Dang Yu... is gonna join the event
with someone else!

13:59.180 --> 14:00.470
[Game Channel]

13:59.360 --> 14:01.030
She's gonna marry another one!

14:01.030 --> 14:02.720
Your girl's getting stolen away?

14:02.720 --> 14:03.270
Don't worry.

14:03.270 --> 14:04.000
We'll help you win her back later.

14:04.000 --> 14:04.670
No, no, no.

14:04.670 --> 14:05.600
Let me explain.

14:05.790 --> 14:08.000
What Jun actually means

14:08.000 --> 14:09.270
is that the girl's game account

14:09.270 --> 14:11.000
is marrying another player's.

14:11.390 --> 14:14.440
It's just a game account—
why are you so worked up over it?

14:14.440 --> 14:15.840
Of course I am!

14:16.030 --> 14:17.910
This game is my parallel world.

14:17.960 --> 14:19.930
Getting married here means just as much

14:19.930 --> 14:21.710
to me as real life!

14:22.110 --> 14:23.090
Hey, how about this?

14:23.090 --> 14:24.620
Use my account to marry hers

14:24.670 --> 14:26.270
multiple times

14:26.290 --> 14:27.390
to make up for it.

14:27.670 --> 14:28.910
Absolutely not.

14:28.910 --> 14:30.390
I definitely want the Prime Minister

14:30.390 --> 14:33.120
to propose to Bad Name
in front of the whole server.

14:33.120 --> 14:34.410
What am I gonna do now?

14:35.270 --> 14:36.360
She can remarry you after her divorce.

14:36.360 --> 14:38.290
It's only a game account after all.

14:38.440 --> 14:39.080
Divorce?

14:39.790 --> 14:40.840
What if she divorces

14:40.840 --> 14:41.720
but still refuses to marry me?

14:41.720 --> 14:42.700
What should I do?

14:43.000 --> 14:44.790
You haven't even won her heart yet,

14:44.790 --> 14:46.440
and you're already hoping she'll divorce.

14:46.440 --> 14:47.390
Jun

14:47.430 --> 14:49.510
is really something.

14:49.750 --> 14:50.880
Then here's an idea—

14:50.950 --> 14:52.390
find someone else to marry,

14:52.390 --> 14:54.630
and you two can hurt each other
back and forth.

14:54.630 --> 14:56.790
No way. I can't bear to hurt her.

14:58.670 --> 14:59.910
I'm gonna win her back.

14:59.910 --> 15:01.740
With my own effort and wits,

15:01.760 --> 15:03.210
I'll get Dang Yu back!

15:07.460 --> 15:09.990
Keep drinking, guys.
I'm heading home first.

15:10.080 --> 15:10.720
Jun!

15:11.600 --> 15:12.060
This...

15:12.360 --> 15:13.200
See?

15:13.310 --> 15:15.320
People really
shouldn't get addicted to games.

15:15.320 --> 15:17.100
It's totally rotted his brain.

15:17.200 --> 15:17.720
Yeah.

15:22.360 --> 15:23.000
[I finally have a ticket to go home.]

15:23.000 --> 15:23.790
[Thank the tenant
for being so resourceful.]

15:25.720 --> 15:28.280
You're the clever one, Li Yifei.

15:28.180 --> 15:30.130
[Qian Fei]

15:28.600 --> 15:30.360
Don't take advantage of me like this.

15:30.360 --> 15:31.030
What's wrong?

15:31.030 --> 15:32.630
Even though we're super close,

15:32.630 --> 15:34.490
you shouldn't bully me like that.

15:32.630 --> 15:34.650
[If you can't repay the favor all at once,
you may serve dishes in installments.]

15:35.320 --> 15:37.060
How did I bully you?

15:37.790 --> 15:39.270
I poured all my effort into getting

15:39.270 --> 15:40.750
a flight ticket for your landlady,

15:40.750 --> 15:42.390
but you're always the one
getting all the credit

15:42.390 --> 15:43.250
in front of her.

15:44.750 --> 15:46.570
Why? Did I never do anything nice for you?

15:46.570 --> 15:48.660
I won't stand for it this time.

15:48.680 --> 15:50.770
You have to introduce her to me.

15:50.840 --> 15:51.630
I admit it.

15:51.650 --> 15:53.550
I've fallen for that tough girl.

15:53.600 --> 15:54.720
I'll go all in no matter what.

15:54.720 --> 15:55.670
It's just getting married anyway.

15:55.670 --> 15:57.460
I wanna be friends with her and date her.

15:57.460 --> 15:58.480
I bought her a flight ticket,

15:58.480 --> 16:00.030
not to do you any favors.

16:03.600 --> 16:05.060
Are you tired of living?

16:06.190 --> 16:07.920
How dare you go after my person?

16:09.360 --> 16:10.150
Don't you remember

16:10.150 --> 16:11.270
back in middle school?

16:11.270 --> 16:13.720
A group of girls surrounded you
and pulled your pants down.

16:13.720 --> 16:15.510
Who saved you? Answer me.

16:15.540 --> 16:17.270
Who pulled your pants up for you,

16:17.270 --> 16:19.640
-fastened your belt, and zipped your fly?
-No, no, nothing like that.

16:19.640 --> 16:21.570
-Now you've forgotten?
-Never heard that before.

16:21.570 --> 16:23.110
I still have the photos.

16:23.600 --> 16:25.440
This will jog your memory

16:25.440 --> 16:26.860
of the huge favor I did you.

16:26.860 --> 16:27.600
-No, no.
-Let me see.

16:27.600 --> 16:29.550
No, nothing like that.

16:30.000 --> 16:30.890
Cut it out.

16:31.080 --> 16:32.510
You call that a huge favor?

16:32.510 --> 16:34.000
That's just bullying and blackmail.

16:34.000 --> 16:35.120
Do you know

16:35.140 --> 16:37.040
I went through so much trouble
to get the ticket?

16:37.040 --> 16:38.560
You're really good at keeping Zihao

16:38.560 --> 16:39.570
under your thumb.

16:39.670 --> 16:41.620
But you're always
talking about her around us.

16:41.620 --> 16:43.270
When are you gonna claim her publicly?

16:43.270 --> 16:45.610
You're the biggest coward if you ask me.

17:09.109 --> 17:10.050
You're here too.

17:09.170 --> 17:11.319
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

17:10.480 --> 17:11.079
Mr. Jiao.

17:11.349 --> 17:14.160
[Charity Banquet
for the Donation to Nature Foundation]

17:16.500 --> 17:17.490
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

17:17.520 --> 17:18.880
[Charity Banquet
for the Donation to Nature Foundation]

17:24.930 --> 17:26.869
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

17:26.240 --> 17:28.700
Boss, it's so lively today.

17:26.890 --> 17:30.890
[Charity Banquet
for the Donation to Nature Foundation]

17:29.190 --> 17:30.040
Right?

17:30.200 --> 17:33.000
Look how many media outlets
have shown up already.

17:33.830 --> 17:36.620
Shanlifang really splurged a fortune
on this event.

17:36.620 --> 17:39.550
This is Liao Shiyu's big chance
to save some dignity.

17:43.410 --> 17:45.680
If this public backlash dies down,

17:45.680 --> 17:48.080
do you think Qian Fei
could get reinstated?

17:48.590 --> 17:49.960
Absolutely for sure.

17:51.590 --> 17:53.320
Are you on close terms with her?

17:55.330 --> 17:56.640
I'm a friend of Qian Fei's.

17:56.640 --> 17:57.820
Let me tell you,

17:57.880 --> 17:59.110
Fei and I tell each other

17:59.110 --> 18:00.570
everything at work.

18:04.420 --> 18:08.020
Even dressed in fancy robes,
he still doesn't look like royalty.

18:09.290 --> 18:10.620
You've got great taste.

18:11.270 --> 18:11.920
Right?

18:12.640 --> 18:13.300
Yeah.

18:16.510 --> 18:17.820
Come to think of it,

18:18.130 --> 18:20.590
he really does look like
a real estate agent.

18:24.230 --> 18:25.040
Hello, Mr. Liao.

18:25.040 --> 18:25.690
Hello.

18:26.310 --> 18:26.830
Mr. Liao.

18:26.830 --> 18:28.110
Hello. Hello.

18:28.150 --> 18:29.900
Mr. Zhang, long time no see.

18:31.620 --> 18:32.680
-Hello, Mr. Liao.
-Hello, Mr. Liao.

18:32.680 --> 18:33.680
Hello. Hello.

18:33.720 --> 18:35.400
-Hello, Mr. Liao.
-Hello, Mr. Liao.

18:35.400 --> 18:37.310
Thank you, everyone.

18:43.200 --> 18:43.880
Excuse me.

19:01.120 --> 19:05.440
[Registration Desk]
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

19:12.990 --> 19:14.100
[Share Love, Spread Kindness]

19:14.130 --> 19:15.390
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

19:15.410 --> 19:16.730
[Charity Banquet
for the Donation to Nature Foundation]

19:20.580 --> 19:22.840
Yifei doesn't seem to be at the scene now.

19:24.720 --> 19:26.050
Why would I look for him?

19:27.200 --> 19:29.280
What brings you here?

19:30.400 --> 19:31.160
Just...

19:33.400 --> 19:35.060
catching up with old friends.

19:50.750 --> 19:51.550
Jinshan.

19:53.720 --> 19:55.180
What a surprise to see you.

19:55.190 --> 19:56.780
It's such an honor

19:56.830 --> 19:58.260
having you here, Mr. Li.

19:59.200 --> 20:00.480
How could I miss

20:00.500 --> 20:02.150
your charity banquet?

20:03.480 --> 20:05.000
Mr. Li, Mr. Li, Mr. Li.

20:05.030 --> 20:06.400
Glad to meet you.

20:06.400 --> 20:06.970
Hello.

20:07.240 --> 20:08.310
May I ask your name?

20:08.470 --> 20:09.810
Sang Shiqi.

20:10.410 --> 20:11.010
Thank you.

20:11.920 --> 20:12.920
Sang Shiqi.

20:15.470 --> 20:16.120
Mr. Sang.

20:17.000 --> 20:18.920
I've long heard great things about you.

20:18.920 --> 20:21.220
Mr. Li, your Qiansheng Group

20:21.400 --> 20:23.410
successfully went public in the US

20:23.480 --> 20:25.160
in less than 2 years back then.

20:25.180 --> 20:26.590
For younger entrepreneurs

20:26.590 --> 20:28.270
like us running companies,

20:28.510 --> 20:31.170
you're absolutely our role model
to learn from.

20:32.070 --> 20:33.310
You flatter me, Mr. Sang.

20:33.310 --> 20:35.330
Overseas markets aren't as promising

20:35.330 --> 20:36.810
as everyone imagines.

20:36.940 --> 20:37.920
But I've heard

20:37.920 --> 20:41.050
you've landed
quite a few solid projects domestically.

20:42.600 --> 20:45.490
There's one called Fulaxida,

20:45.920 --> 20:46.480
right?

20:47.790 --> 20:49.800
Yes, that project exists.

20:50.000 --> 20:50.960
B-But

20:50.980 --> 20:53.010
it's nothing big,

20:53.040 --> 20:54.570
just a tiny little venture.

20:55.880 --> 20:56.770
Small as it may be,

20:56.770 --> 20:57.980
I heard

20:58.000 --> 21:00.600
it falls
under a key national industry sector.

21:01.400 --> 21:02.660
Mr. Li, let me toast you.

21:02.660 --> 21:03.470
Sure, cheers.

21:07.750 --> 21:10.310
Our company
is the domestic agent for French wineries.

21:10.310 --> 21:12.980
We can customize
exclusive wine for hotels.

21:13.400 --> 21:14.610
Feel free
to come to our company for a visit.

21:14.610 --> 21:15.740
We've already selected the venue.

21:15.740 --> 21:17.200
We're just waiting for your news.

21:17.200 --> 21:20.200
That's great. We haven't expanded
into Yangling yet.

21:21.550 --> 21:23.960
Liao's prospective son-in-law

21:24.000 --> 21:26.110
has been rushing around the whole venue
with Liao's daughter today.

21:26.110 --> 21:27.570
He's quite good-looking.

21:27.830 --> 21:29.010
But it's hard to say

21:29.350 --> 21:31.880
whether he can land
such a high-status match.

21:32.160 --> 21:33.130
The wall cladding material

21:33.130 --> 21:35.400
is all marble imported from Italy by us.

21:36.590 --> 21:38.900
It really makes the place
look gorgeous and luxurious.

21:38.900 --> 21:39.550
Exactly.

21:39.580 --> 21:41.240
I heard the young man
has no family background at all.

21:41.240 --> 21:43.700
He's just a self-made man
from a poor family.

21:43.720 --> 21:46.340
Liao is really generous.

21:47.310 --> 21:49.420
Just look at his demeanor.

21:49.590 --> 21:50.550
No matter how you look at him,

21:50.550 --> 21:53.550
he carries the air of someone
from a humble household.

21:53.680 --> 21:55.030
Timid and awkward.

21:56.000 --> 21:58.050
Even if he marries into the family,

21:58.240 --> 22:03.460
he'll have to cater to his wife's family
for the rest of his life.

22:05.200 --> 22:07.440
We can develop businesses

22:07.440 --> 22:08.390
in other cities.

22:09.400 --> 22:12.180
I wouldn't even care to do so.

22:53.640 --> 22:54.720
Do you see that?

22:54.750 --> 22:57.240
Liao Shiyu will take the stage
in less than half an hour.

22:57.240 --> 22:59.040
You'd better seize your chance.

23:00.550 --> 23:03.150
There are crowds of people
sitting beside her.

23:03.750 --> 23:05.350
I just don't understand you.

23:05.510 --> 23:07.440
What exactly are you striving for?

23:07.960 --> 23:09.620
Between He Jing and Shanlifang,

23:09.620 --> 23:12.480
neither company deserves
all this effort from you.

23:13.920 --> 23:15.430
If I were you,

23:15.680 --> 23:18.880
I would just wait and watch them
make fools of themselves.

23:21.360 --> 23:22.440
Stay here for a while.

23:22.440 --> 23:24.570
I'm going over to check the situation.

23:31.550 --> 23:33.950
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

23:31.820 --> 23:33.640
Please keep track
of the final result for me later.

23:33.640 --> 23:34.280
Sure.

23:33.980 --> 23:36.720
[Charity Banquet
for the Donation to Nature Foundation]

23:34.590 --> 23:35.480
Alright, alright.

23:35.480 --> 23:36.850
Let's exchange contact information later.

23:36.850 --> 23:37.330
Okay.

23:40.480 --> 23:42.080
Thanks for your well wishes.

23:58.830 --> 23:59.750
What are you doing?

23:59.750 --> 24:00.810
What are you doing?

24:11.570 --> 24:13.480
You've got some nerve.

24:14.750 --> 24:16.200
Why are you pretending to be a waiter?

24:16.200 --> 24:17.530
Here to crash the event?

24:18.800 --> 24:20.400
You're not even furious.

24:20.430 --> 24:22.360
Did you know I was coming all along?

24:22.550 --> 24:24.040
Let me tell you.

24:24.960 --> 24:27.510
When I saw you take this uniform home,

24:27.540 --> 24:29.490
how calm you stayed
after the company suspended you,

24:29.490 --> 24:32.370
and that you sent Yao Jingjing
to bid for this charity banquet,

24:32.370 --> 24:34.630
I figured out exactly what you were up to.

24:35.370 --> 24:36.900
You planned this all along.

24:37.300 --> 24:38.840
You knew, yet you still asked.

24:38.840 --> 24:39.820
Either cooperate with me,

24:39.820 --> 24:40.880
or get out of my way.

24:43.440 --> 24:44.240
I'm telling you,

24:44.240 --> 24:45.570
you can't fix this mess.

24:45.720 --> 24:47.050
Mind your own business.

24:57.800 --> 24:58.970
She's looking over here.

24:58.970 --> 24:59.740
Why were you walking straight toward her?

24:59.740 --> 25:01.070
Are you out of your mind?

25:05.900 --> 25:07.210
You smell nice today.

25:07.830 --> 25:09.140
Did I smell bad before?

25:10.920 --> 25:11.750
Let me tell you...

25:11.750 --> 25:12.560
Is she gone?

25:19.640 --> 25:20.280
Listen...

25:20.300 --> 25:22.300
She's gone. I'm heading over first.

26:03.000 --> 26:05.070
Why are you sitting here drinking alone?

26:05.070 --> 26:07.130
I just want some quiet time to myself.

26:15.230 --> 26:15.840
Qian Fei?

26:17.560 --> 26:18.890
What are you doing here?

26:20.680 --> 26:24.240
Ms. Liao, I've drafted a speech

26:24.840 --> 26:26.400
about the apology proposal from last time.

26:26.400 --> 26:28.530
I hope you can think it over carefully.

26:29.960 --> 26:30.550
Qian Fei,

26:30.960 --> 26:32.440
you're really resourceful.

26:32.440 --> 26:34.070
You even found a way to get in here.

26:34.070 --> 26:35.710
Go change out of this uniform.

26:35.710 --> 26:36.970
Grab something to eat.

26:37.200 --> 26:38.180
There are lots of media here tonight.

26:38.180 --> 26:39.640
I won't put you on the spot.

26:39.640 --> 26:40.500
No matter what,

26:40.920 --> 26:42.260
please read this first

26:42.350 --> 26:43.810
before making a decision.

26:55.850 --> 26:57.560
When the first batch
of videos was released,

26:57.560 --> 26:59.760
Shanlifang buried its head in the sand,

27:00.000 --> 27:01.530
trying to gloss over the incident.

27:01.530 --> 27:04.530
Right after that,
the second batch of videos came out.

27:04.680 --> 27:05.590
This clearly shows

27:05.590 --> 27:07.570
someone planned all of this ahead of time.

27:07.570 --> 27:09.790
So no matter how spectacular

27:09.910 --> 27:11.070
and influential this charity banquet is,

27:11.070 --> 27:13.030
once the third batch
of videos gets released,

27:13.030 --> 27:14.240
Shanlifang will completely

27:14.240 --> 27:15.780
lose the public's trust.

27:15.940 --> 27:17.940
It will jeopardize the hotel's IPO.

27:19.490 --> 27:21.690
Then what do you think we should do?

27:22.240 --> 27:24.600
I think we should sincerely
apologize to the public

27:24.600 --> 27:28.090
and carry out comprehensive rectification
from top to bottom.

27:28.090 --> 27:29.960
The first two batches of videos
have already been circulated.

27:29.960 --> 27:31.830
The negative impact brought to Shanlifang

27:31.830 --> 27:33.110
is irreparable.

27:33.130 --> 27:35.240
We have no choice
but to accept this result.

27:35.240 --> 27:36.750
But as long as you're decisive enough

27:36.750 --> 27:38.210
to conduct full-scale reforms,

27:38.210 --> 27:39.880
I believe Shanlifang can fix

27:39.880 --> 27:42.680
all the hotel hygiene loopholes this time.

27:43.220 --> 27:46.310
Therefore, no matter how many more videos
get released later,

27:46.310 --> 27:47.380
they can only prove

27:47.400 --> 27:49.860
all the footage was taken a long time ago,

27:49.960 --> 27:52.420
and someone is deliberately
smearing us and spreading false rumors.

27:52.420 --> 27:54.620
You can take legal action against them.

27:55.250 --> 27:56.110
Have you considered

27:56.110 --> 27:58.170
what apologizing right now entails?

27:59.480 --> 28:00.790
An apology means consumers

28:00.790 --> 28:02.110
get basic respect,

28:02.480 --> 28:03.720
and it also shows
Shanlifang's determination

28:03.720 --> 28:05.780
and attitude to fully fix all issues.

28:09.860 --> 28:11.080
How many meetings have we held

28:11.080 --> 28:12.440
to settle on this plan?

28:12.470 --> 28:14.220
If we had planned
to apologize from the very beginning,

28:14.220 --> 28:16.460
we wouldn't have
set aside 9 million for preparations.

28:16.460 --> 28:17.390
Apologizing now

28:18.050 --> 28:19.330
is basically admitting we're at fault.

28:19.330 --> 28:19.850
No.

28:20.240 --> 28:21.270
Things have come this far.

28:21.270 --> 28:23.000
Can you still deny everything,

28:23.000 --> 28:23.750
Wang Ruohai?

28:25.400 --> 28:26.930
You only need to take this one risk.

28:26.930 --> 28:27.880
If you succeed,

28:28.640 --> 28:30.950
I believe Ms. Liao will truly value you.

28:32.730 --> 28:34.390
I think this means a lot to you,

28:35.110 --> 28:37.360
and also to the two of you.

28:44.240 --> 28:44.960
Qian Fei,

28:45.070 --> 28:47.000
why do you want to save Shanlifang?

28:48.510 --> 28:50.040
I'm not saving Shanlifang.

28:50.640 --> 28:51.920
I'm saving the IPO project

28:51.920 --> 28:53.160
assigned to He Jing by Shanlifang.

28:53.160 --> 28:54.220
I'm saving myself.

28:56.720 --> 28:58.090
So many reporters
are waiting at the entrance,

28:58.090 --> 28:59.740
all here for the charity banquet.

28:59.740 --> 29:01.370
If we totally change the theme now,

29:01.370 --> 29:02.570
the risk is too great.

29:05.890 --> 29:08.220
All the materials I prepared are in there.

29:08.720 --> 29:11.180
I still hope you
can think it over carefully.

29:23.590 --> 29:24.940
Such a big incident has happened,

29:24.940 --> 29:27.030
yet you don't have
any constructive advice.

29:27.030 --> 29:28.830
All you do is hide here drinking.

29:29.350 --> 29:30.800
I'll sober up and go out soon.

29:30.800 --> 29:32.130
Tonight's event

29:32.200 --> 29:34.600
is meant for Dad
to bring you to meet people.

29:34.640 --> 29:36.120
It's such an important occasion.

29:36.120 --> 29:37.340
Every word and move you make stands for

29:37.340 --> 29:38.340
not only yourself

29:38.550 --> 29:40.080
but also Shanlifang and me.

29:41.230 --> 29:42.600
I know you're important,

29:42.600 --> 29:43.870
I know your father is important,

29:43.870 --> 29:45.110
and I know Shanlifang is important.

29:45.110 --> 29:46.160
Am I not important?

29:46.160 --> 29:48.020
Isn't my whole family important?

29:50.510 --> 29:52.510
When I stepped into this venue today,

29:52.510 --> 29:53.760
everyone was whispering about

29:53.760 --> 29:54.860
who I am to you,

29:54.950 --> 29:56.170
who I am to your father,

29:56.170 --> 29:57.640
and who I am to Shanlifang.

29:58.900 --> 30:00.100
I've lived for more than 20 years,

30:00.100 --> 30:01.090
and only now do I realize

30:01.090 --> 30:02.640
I can only define myself

30:02.800 --> 30:04.500
through all of you.

30:06.840 --> 30:08.550
Do you hold so much resentment toward me?

30:08.550 --> 30:10.550
Don't you like the life you have now?

30:12.940 --> 30:15.250
I thought this was everything
you'd ever wanted.

30:15.250 --> 30:16.580
I thought you'd love it.

30:16.780 --> 30:18.080
I just want to be myself.

30:18.080 --> 30:19.650
Then you need to fight for that identity
on your own.

30:19.650 --> 30:20.740
How others see you

30:21.070 --> 30:23.350
depends on how you see and treat yourself.

30:23.350 --> 30:25.280
Take tonight's event as an example.

30:25.280 --> 30:26.920
There are so many people out there.

30:26.920 --> 30:29.980
It doesn't look good for both of us
to be gone for so long.

30:30.480 --> 30:31.920
Take your time finishing your drink.

30:31.920 --> 30:33.250
I have work to attend to.

30:35.570 --> 30:36.330
Shiyu.

30:38.950 --> 30:41.150
I've thought about this for a long time.

30:41.330 --> 30:43.390
I can never live up to your standards.

30:45.990 --> 30:47.000
Let's break up.

31:29.210 --> 31:30.250
Shanlifang Hotel Group

31:30.270 --> 31:32.890
[Charity Banquet
for the Donation to Nature Foundation]

31:42.200 --> 31:42.730
Shanlifang Hotel Group

31:42.760 --> 31:43.310
[Charity Banquet
for the Donation to Nature Foundation]

31:47.550 --> 31:49.550
Good evening, everyone.

31:47.980 --> 31:49.150
Shanlifang Hotel Group

31:49.180 --> 31:50.730
[Charity Banquet
for the Donation to Nature Foundation]

31:49.830 --> 31:51.920
I am Liao Shiyu,

31:51.920 --> 31:52.640
Vice President of Shanlifang Hotel Group.

31:52.640 --> 31:55.110
First of all, on behalf
of Shanlifang Hotel Group,

31:55.110 --> 31:58.040
I'd like to welcome all of you
to our charity banquet.

32:14.830 --> 32:17.240
Shanlifang Hotel Group

32:15.550 --> 32:17.220
As you may have felt,

32:17.260 --> 32:19.370
[Charity Banquet
for the Donation to Nature Foundation]

32:17.310 --> 32:18.650
Shanlifang Hotel Group

32:18.680 --> 32:19.590
has always been committed to

32:19.590 --> 32:21.680
delivering top-tier service to consumers.

32:21.680 --> 32:22.830
We place special emphasis on

32:22.830 --> 32:24.310
indoor air quality within our hotels.

32:24.310 --> 32:25.310
Up to now,

32:25.400 --> 32:26.610
all hundreds
of Shanlifang Hotel Group outlets

32:26.610 --> 32:28.230
nationwide

32:28.260 --> 32:30.790
have adopted
world-class fresh air systems.

32:31.110 --> 32:32.880
The temperature
and humidity in the atrium areas

32:31.190 --> 32:32.000
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

32:32.030 --> 32:32.970
[Charity Banquet
for the Donation to Nature Foundation]

32:32.990 --> 32:35.040
have met international standards.

32:35.070 --> 32:35.960
Of course,

32:36.030 --> 32:38.310
none of this would be possible
without the Nature Foundation.

32:38.310 --> 32:39.200
It is you

32:39.200 --> 32:41.510
who have provided us
with eco-friendly technical support.

32:41.510 --> 32:43.910
Now, please allow me to formally introduce

32:43.950 --> 32:45.310
Ms. Song, China Representative

32:45.310 --> 32:46.960
of the Nature Foundation.

33:07.540 --> 33:08.970
Shanlifang Hotel Group

33:09.000 --> 33:10.880
will donate 9 million RMB

33:10.900 --> 33:12.300
to the Nature Foundation

33:12.410 --> 33:14.440
for wildlife and plant conservation

33:14.440 --> 33:15.680
in Southwest China.

33:23.170 --> 33:25.780
[Donation Cheque] [Nine Million RMB Only]

33:34.810 --> 33:35.820
[Donation Cheque] [Nine Million RMB Only]

33:41.380 --> 33:42.340
Next,

33:42.370 --> 33:43.800
I will play a short video

33:43.830 --> 33:45.270
to show you

33:45.400 --> 33:48.060
the latest upgrades
at Shanlifang Hotel Group.

33:51.350 --> 33:52.750
What on earth is going on?

34:02.280 --> 34:03.780
How could this happen?

34:05.180 --> 34:05.880
What should we do?

34:05.880 --> 34:06.920
Shall we cut the big screen off
right away?

34:06.920 --> 34:08.250
Hold on a little longer.

34:08.510 --> 34:09.840
Come over here quickly.

34:10.400 --> 34:11.860
Keep rolling the cameras.

34:14.320 --> 34:15.280
Director.

34:35.440 --> 34:37.639
I've put everything on the line for you.

34:47.320 --> 34:48.150
An apology means

34:48.150 --> 34:49.929
consumers get basic respect,

34:50.030 --> 34:51.110
and it also shows
Shanlifang's determination

34:51.110 --> 34:52.360
and attitude

34:52.360 --> 34:53.690
to fully fix all issues.

35:04.110 --> 35:05.660
As you have all witnessed,

35:06.000 --> 35:08.190
after thorough internal discussions,

35:08.190 --> 35:09.920
Shanlifang has decided to take this chance

35:09.920 --> 35:12.850
to release an official statement

35:12.880 --> 35:15.940
regarding the hotel room hygiene incidents
this week.

35:16.510 --> 35:19.310
Following careful
and rigorous investigations,

35:19.340 --> 35:23.000
Shanlifang confirms all issues
shown in the footage are factual.

35:37.340 --> 35:38.380
We hereby

35:39.150 --> 35:42.480
offer our sincerest apologies to everyone.

36:04.570 --> 36:06.000
We welcome all consumers

36:06.020 --> 36:07.710
to keep supervising us

36:07.850 --> 36:08.960
and witness

36:08.960 --> 36:11.040
our rectification progress
and determination together.

36:11.040 --> 36:12.150
However, if anyone

36:12.180 --> 36:15.650
attempts to slander Shanlifang
by taking advantage of this incident,

36:15.650 --> 36:17.450
we will resort to legal measures

36:17.780 --> 36:21.240
to safeguard Shanlifang's
legitimate rights and interests.

36:21.620 --> 36:22.190
Great!

36:47.440 --> 36:49.240
Everything's gone chaotic now.

36:50.000 --> 36:51.460
Didn't you cause all this?

36:53.690 --> 36:55.250
Could it be Wang Ruohai then?

36:55.250 --> 36:57.580
I left the USB drive
on the table back then.

37:38.680 --> 37:39.570
Well done.

37:40.660 --> 37:41.990
Totally professional.

37:51.810 --> 37:52.700
Let's go, Boss.

38:10.000 --> 38:10.880
Mission accomplished.

38:10.880 --> 38:12.480
Why are you standing here
grinning like an idiot?

38:12.480 --> 38:13.260
Let's move.

38:38.150 --> 38:42.290
♪ Also, there's no need
to force the closest bonds ♪

38:39.040 --> 38:40.040
Drive carefully.

38:42.900 --> 38:43.900
Put some music on.

38:44.910 --> 38:49.580
♪ I might be left alone,
but I have your warmth ♪

38:53.010 --> 38:57.740
♪ And there's no need to dwell
on right or wrong—not because of fear ♪

38:59.860 --> 39:05.590
♪ A hug far outweighs endless apologies ♪

39:06.930 --> 39:09.040
♪ I'll show you the wider world ♪

39:10.030 --> 39:13.140
♪ It's only in blazing bright
that I am who I am ♪

39:14.660 --> 39:20.240
♪ Quietly carry it all, like a harbor
sheltering your drifting soul ♪

39:21.340 --> 39:22.100
What are you doing?

39:21.670 --> 39:23.590
♪ When you return to your peaceful life ♪

39:24.700 --> 39:27.620
♪ The light at home glows warm
day and night ♪

39:26.430 --> 39:27.580
You look kind of cute

39:27.600 --> 39:28.870
like this.

39:29.450 --> 39:31.360
♪ Stay forever by each other's side ♪

39:33.010 --> 39:38.700
♪ Like the stars and the moon
hanging brightly in the sky ♪

39:34.550 --> 39:35.670
Stop staring at me.

39:36.030 --> 39:36.890
Watch the road.

39:47.850 --> 39:50.180
[Resignation Letter]
[Applicant: Wang Ruohai]

39:53.190 --> 39:53.990
Unfortunately,

39:53.870 --> 39:56.380
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

39:54.510 --> 39:55.910
you still chose to leave.

39:59.650 --> 40:01.980
Is there nothing left
you want to say to me?

40:06.440 --> 40:07.240
Wait a second.

40:11.360 --> 40:12.930
I know you often

40:13.380 --> 40:15.330
compare me with Qian Fei.

40:15.770 --> 40:17.980
Qian Fei is diligent and considerate,

40:18.970 --> 40:20.050
but I'm not.

40:22.690 --> 40:23.940
I'm a spoiled young lady

40:23.940 --> 40:26.000
who's been coddled since childhood.

40:26.440 --> 40:28.770
You have to fetch me water
when I'm thirsty

40:28.910 --> 40:32.170
and keep me company for late-night snacks
when I'm hungry.

40:33.010 --> 40:36.240
On festivals and holidays,
I could never be like Qian Fei,

40:36.590 --> 40:37.360
remembering

40:37.360 --> 40:38.360
to buy gifts for your parents

40:38.360 --> 40:39.690
and visit them with you.

40:40.000 --> 40:40.670
Besides,

40:42.280 --> 40:45.680
I've constantly embarrassed you
in front of your colleagues

40:45.780 --> 40:47.830
and forced you into things you hate.

40:48.780 --> 40:49.870
For all of this,

40:51.550 --> 40:53.320
I owe you an apology.

40:53.850 --> 40:55.450
Everything I've done for you

40:55.950 --> 40:57.520
was voluntary.

40:58.360 --> 41:00.020
But I've been thinking lately

41:01.390 --> 41:03.220
that I really treated Qian Fei

41:04.370 --> 41:05.770
far too poorly back then.

41:06.340 --> 41:08.140
Every time this crosses my mind,

41:09.880 --> 41:11.350
my heart aches terribly.

41:14.200 --> 41:15.930
My mother's been ill recently,

41:16.680 --> 41:18.280
and while taking care of her,

41:18.630 --> 41:19.760
I've come to realize

41:23.920 --> 41:25.000
what I truly need

41:26.890 --> 41:27.890
is a relationship

41:28.060 --> 41:30.720
built on mutual support
through thick and thin.

41:32.610 --> 41:33.940
Does that mean all we had

41:34.850 --> 41:37.650
was nothing but vanity
and career advancement?

41:41.660 --> 41:42.450
Anyway,

41:46.400 --> 41:47.250
I'm sorry.

41:52.140 --> 41:52.970
Goodbye.

42:32.550 --> 42:33.750
Isn't this my laptop?

42:36.470 --> 42:39.200
Were you the one
who played that video last night?

42:41.440 --> 42:43.670
Have you figured out how to thank me yet?

42:48.230 --> 42:50.090
When did you

42:50.360 --> 42:51.800
find out my exact plan?

42:52.360 --> 42:53.760
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.150 --> 42:55.780
When did you

42:56.180 --> 42:57.820
find out my exact plan?

42:58.440 --> 42:59.400
And when did you

42:59.420 --> 43:00.910
steal my laptop

43:01.220 --> 43:02.590
and do all this behind my back?

43:02.590 --> 43:04.500
Were you waiting for me to leave,

43:04.700 --> 43:06.130
so you could bring
your internet celebrity girlfriend

43:06.130 --> 43:07.410
to stay here for the New Year?

43:07.410 --> 43:08.340
You mean Jinzi?

43:08.370 --> 43:09.840
She's not my girlfriend at all.

43:09.840 --> 43:11.090
I don't have a girlfriend.

43:11.090 --> 43:13.380
You're still making excuses
and refusing to confess.

43:13.380 --> 43:13.930
Hello?

43:13.960 --> 43:15.000
Yifei.

43:15.550 --> 43:17.340
I'm on the pedestrian street
near your apartment.

43:17.340 --> 43:19.070
My stomach suddenly hurts terribly.

43:19.070 --> 43:21.000
Could you come help me?

43:22.150 --> 43:22.870
I...
